# 🎓 LearnForge: AI-Powered Tutoring & Adaptive Learning Platform

> **Turn any textbook, PDF, or topic into a living, voice-driven, 3D-avatar-led learning experience, in seconds.**

LearnForge is an end-to-end, **multi-modal, retrieval-augmented AI education platform** that converts static learning material (PDFs, textbooks, free-form topic inputs) into an interactive, tutor-led curriculum. It fuses **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)**, **ultra-low-latency LLM inference on Groq (LLaMA 3 8B & 70B)**, **speech-to-text (Whisper)**, **neural text-to-speech (GCP Studio Voices)**, a **fully client-side real-time 3D talking avatar (Three.js + Web Audio API)**, and **web-scraped resource enrichment (Serper)** into a single cohesive, cloud-deployable product.

