## 🎯 Problem Statement

Traditional digital learning suffers from four systemic gaps:

| Gap | Impact |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Static content** | PDFs and textbooks are passive, non-interactive, and one-size-fits-all. |
| **No personalized pacing** | Learners cannot get instant, context-aware answers to follow-up questions. |
| **Low engagement** | Text-only interfaces lack the human presence of a real tutor. |
| **No feedback loop** | Learners rarely get diagnostic assessment tied directly to *what they just studied*. |

## 💡 Our Solution

LearnForge closes these gaps with a **grounded, multi-modal AI tutor**:

- **Grounded** in the learner's *own* material via RAG, which reduces LLM hallucination.
- **Fast** thanks to Groq's LPU-accelerated inference, so responses feel conversational.
- **Embodied** through a 3D avatar that speaks with real-time, audio-reactive lip-sync.
- **Adaptive** through diagnostic quizzes, evaluation, and targeted improvement pointers.
- **Enriched** with curated real-world resources scraped from top educational portals.

---

## 🌟 Key Features

### 1. 📄 Document Ingestion & Curriculum Generation
- Ingests uploaded **PDF textbooks** or user-provided **topic prompts** (e.g., *Convolutional Neural Networks*).
- Automatically produces a **hierarchical subtopic tree**, **concept roadmap**, and **structured summary explanations**.
- Uses **vectorless, reasoning-based retrieval (PageIndex)** to build a document tree index instead of relying on chunk-and-embed pipelines.

### 2. 🗣️ Interactive AI Tutor (Voice + Text)
- Conversational Q&A grounded in retrieved document context (**RAG pipeline**).
- Powered by **Groq-hosted LLaMA 3 (8B for low-latency tasks, 70B for deep reasoning)** with sub-second time-to-first-token.
- **Hands-free voice interaction** through **Groq Whisper (STT)**.

### 3. 🧑‍🏫 Real-Time 3D Talking Avatar
- **Fully client-side** rendering with **Three.js** and **GLTF/GLB** models, so no server-side video rendering is needed.
- **Procedural, amplitude-driven lip-sync** using the **Web Audio API**: an `AnalyserNode` computes the **RMS amplitude** of the live audio waveform and maps it to mouth/jaw animation every frame.
- Futuristic **light-blue gradient stage** with **concentric halo rings** and **dynamic floating keyword cards** populated from web-scraped data.

### 4. 🔊 Automated Summary Speech (Neural TTS)
- High-fidelity speech synthesis via **GCP Text-to-Speech (Studio Voices)**.
- **Automatic fallback to `gTTS`** for resilience when the primary provider is unavailable or rate-limited.
- Audio is persisted in **AWS S3** (CDN-style delivery) and **MongoDB GridFS** (binary storage with metadata), ensuring durability and fast replay.

### 5. 🌐 Web-Scraped Resource Enrichment
- Integrates the **Serper API** to fetch real-world educational links from portals such as **Byju's, Vedantu, Toppr, and Aakash**.
- Extracted keywords and links are surfaced inside the avatar stage and resource panels.

### 6. 📝 Diagnostic Assessment & Evaluation
- **Context-aware quiz generation** derived from the retrieved document content.
- **LLM-based answer evaluation** with actionable feedback and targeted improvement pointers.
- Progress persisted in MongoDB for longitudinal tracking.

### 7. 🔐 Flexible Authentication
- **Clerk Auth** (`@clerk/react`) for authenticated, cross-device profiles with session management.
- **Guest mode** with **anonymous browser-scoped identities**, for zero-friction onboarding.

