## 🏗️ System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Client["🖥️ Client (React 18 + TypeScript + Vite)"]
        UI["UI Layer<br/>TailwindCSS · Lucide"]
        AUTH["Clerk Auth / Guest Identity"]
        AVATAR["3D Avatar Engine<br/>Three.js · GLTFLoader"]
        AUDIO["Web Audio API<br/>AnalyserNode · RMS Lip-Sync"]
        MIC["MediaRecorder<br/>Voice Capture"]
    end

    subgraph Server["⚙️ Backend (Python 3.11 + Flask)"]
        API["REST API Layer<br/>CORS · Gunicorn"]
        ROT["Groq Key Rotation<br/>Round-Robin Load Balancer"]
        RAG["RAG Orchestrator"]
        QUIZ["Quiz Generator & Evaluator"]
        TTSV["TTS Service<br/>GCP Studio → gTTS Fallback"]
        ENR["Resource Enrichment Service"]
    end

    subgraph External["☁️ External Services"]
        GROQ["Groq API<br/>LLaMA 3 8B/70B · Whisper STT"]
        PI["PageIndex<br/>Vectorless Retriever"]
        SERPER["Serper API<br/>Web Search/Scrape"]
        GCP["GCP Text-to-Speech"]
    end

    subgraph Storage["🗄️ Persistence"]
        MONGO[("MongoDB<br/>Documents · Progress")]
        GRID[("GridFS<br/>Audio Binaries")]
        S3[("AWS S3<br/>Audio Delivery")]
    end

    UI --> AUTH
    UI --> API
    MIC --> API
    API --> RAG
    API --> QUIZ
    API --> TTSV
    API --> ENR
    RAG --> PI
    RAG --> ROT --> GROQ
    QUIZ --> ROT
    ENR --> SERPER
    TTSV --> GCP
    TTSV --> S3
    TTSV --> GRID
    API --> MONGO
    S3 --> AUDIO
    AUDIO --> AVATAR
```

### Architectural Principles

- **Separation of concerns**: a decoupled SPA frontend and a stateless REST backend, deployed independently.
- **Client-side compute offloading**: 3D rendering and lip-sync run in the browser, which keeps server cost and latency low.
- **Provider resilience**: multi-key LLM rotation and TTS fallback chains remove single points of failure.
- **Grounded generation**: retrieved context is injected into prompts so outputs stay tied to source material.

