## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend (`LearnFront`)

| Technology | Role / Usage |
| :--- | :--- |
| **React 18 & TypeScript** | Component-based architecture with static type safety |
| **Vite** | Lightning-fast HMR dev server and optimized production bundler |
| **TailwindCSS** | Utility-first styling and responsive design system |
| **Three.js & GLTFLoader** | WebGL 3D avatar rendering, scene graph, and animation loop |
| **Web Audio API** | `AnalyserNode` waveform analysis for RMS-based lip-sync |
| **Clerk Auth (`@clerk/react`)** | Authentication, session management, and user profiles |
| **Lucide React** | Consistent, lightweight icon system |

### Backend (`LearnBack`)

| Technology | Role / Usage |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Python 3.11+ & Flask** | RESTful API server and background workers |
| **Gunicorn** | Production WSGI HTTP server |
| **Groq API** | LPU-accelerated LLaMA 3 inference and Whisper STT |
| **MongoDB & GridFS (PyMongo)** | Document store for content, progress, and audio metadata, plus binary storage |
| **PageIndex Vectorless Retriever** | Tree-structured document retrieval for contextual RAG |
| **GCP Text-to-Speech / gTTS** | Neural speech synthesis with automatic fallback |
| **AWS S3 (boto3)** | Cloud object storage and audio delivery |
| **Serper API** | Web search/scraping for educational reference links |

### AI / ML Layer

| Capability | Technology |
| :--- | :--- |
| Large Language Models | LLaMA 3 8B & 70B (via Groq) |
| Speech-to-Text (ASR) | Whisper (via Groq) |
| Text-to-Speech | GCP Studio Voices, gTTS |
| Retrieval | Vectorless, reasoning-based tree retrieval (PageIndex) |
| Generation Strategy | Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), prompt-grounded generation |

