## ⚖️ Design Decisions & Trade-offs

| Decision | Rationale | Trade-off |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Vectorless RAG (PageIndex)** over vector DB | Preserves document structure, avoids embedding infrastructure | Depends on an external retrieval service |
| **Client-side 3D avatar** | Zero server rendering cost, instant interactivity | Needs a WebGL-capable device |
| **Procedural RMS lip-sync** over viseme timelines | Works with any audio source, no extra API calls | Less phonetically precise than viseme-based sync |
| **Groq LPU inference** | Sub-second responses for natural conversation | Subject to provider rate limits (mitigated by key rotation) |
| **TTS fallback chain** | High availability of audio features | Fallback voice quality is lower than Studio Voices |
| **Guest mode** | Frictionless onboarding | Progress is browser-bound until the learner signs in |

---

## 🔒 Security & Privacy

- **Secrets management**: all credentials live in environment variables, never in source control.
- **CORS allow-listing**: `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` restricts which frontends can call the API.
- **Managed authentication**: Clerk handles credential storage, sessions, and token handling.
- **Anonymous guest identities**: no personal data is required to use the platform.
- **Scoped cloud access**: use least-privilege **IAM policies** for the S3 bucket.

---

## 📈 Scalability & Performance

- **Stateless API design** allows horizontal scaling behind a load balancer.
- **Gunicorn multi-worker** serving increases request concurrency.
- **Browser-side rendering** moves GPU-intensive work off the server.
- **Object storage (S3)** offloads audio delivery from the application tier.
- **Multi-key LLM rotation** raises effective throughput under rate limits.
- **Model tiering (8B/70B)** balances cost, latency, and answer quality.

---

## 🗺️ Roadmap

- [ ] **Viseme-based lip-sync** for higher phonetic accuracy
- [ ] **Multilingual tutoring** (STT, LLM, and TTS in regional languages)
- [ ] **Spaced-repetition engine** driven by quiz performance
- [ ] **Learner knowledge graph** for adaptive path planning
- [ ] **Streaming responses (SSE/WebSocket)** for token-by-token tutor replies
- [ ] **Teacher dashboard** with class-level analytics
- [ ] **Response caching** (Redis) to cut repeated LLM calls
- [ ] **Containerization** (Docker) and **CI/CD** pipelines

